---
layout: layouts/landing.njk
description: "Overseer is an AI computer vision and spatial intelligence platform: real-time detection, tracking, monocular depth, 3D reconstruction, cross-camera re-identification and event analytics, self-hosted and offline-capable."
---
<div class="landing">

  <section class="hero-v">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">AI Computer Vision · Spatial Intelligence</p>
      <h1>Turn any camera into spatial intelligence.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Detection, depth, 3D reconstruction and cross-camera identity. Self-hosted and offline-capable.</p>
      <div class="cta">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ '/docs/quick-start/' | url }}">Get started</a>
        <a class="btn" href="{{ site.repo }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub →</a>
      </div>
      <p class="meta">v{{ site.release.version }} · <a href="{{ '/changelog/' | url }}">changelog</a> · MIT</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="hero-frame reveal">
      <img src="{{ '/assets/img/shots/dock.webp' | url }}" width="1460" height="900"
        alt="Overseer console on a live harbour camera: detections, a depth-locked tactical radar and metrics." fetchpriority="high">
      <figcaption class="frame-cap">Live console · detection + depth-locked tactical radar</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <div class="statbar reveal">
    {% for s in site.stats %}<div class="stat"><div class="v">{{ s.value }}</div><div class="l">{{ s.label }}</div></div>{% endfor %}
  </div>

  <section class="frow reveal">
    <figure class="shot-frame"><img loading="lazy" src="{{ '/assets/img/shots/detect.webp' | url }}" width="1460" height="900" alt="Live detection overlays with track ids"></figure>
    <div class="frow-copy">
      <p class="section-label">Perception</p>
      <h2>Detection &amp; tracking</h2>
      <p class="muted">People, vehicles, animals and hazards, followed with stable identities through occlusion.</p>
      <div class="chips">{% for t in ["YOLO11","ByteTrack","Class gating"] %}<span class="chip">{{ t }}</span>{% endfor %}</div>
      <a class="more" href="{{ '/features/' | url }}">Features →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="frow reverse reveal">
    <figure class="shot-frame"><img loading="lazy" src="{{ '/assets/img/shots/spatial.webp' | url }}" width="1460" height="900" alt="A 3D point-cloud reconstruction of a scene from monocular depth"></figure>
    <div class="frow-copy">
      <p class="section-label">Depth &amp; 3D</p>
      <h2>Lift a frame into 3D</h2>
      <p class="muted">Monocular depth reconstructs a navigable point cloud, and places contacts on a depth-locked radar.</p>
      <div class="chips">{% for t in ["Depth Anything V2","Point cloud","Foresight"] %}<span class="chip">{{ t }}</span>{% endfor %}</div>
      <a class="more" href="{{ '/models/depth-anything-v2/' | url }}">Depth model →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="frow reveal">
    <figure class="shot-frame"><img loading="lazy" src="{{ '/assets/img/shots/density.webp' | url }}" width="1460" height="900" alt="Crowd-density heatmap over a live feed"></figure>
    <div class="frow-copy">
      <p class="section-label">Analytics</p>
      <h2>Density, events &amp; alerts</h2>
      <p class="muted">Live heatmaps and correlated threat scoring turn perception into the alerts that matter.</p>
      <div class="chips">{% for t in ["Heatmaps","Zones","Threat scoring"] %}<span class="chip">{{ t }}</span>{% endfor %}</div>
      <a class="more" href="{{ '/features/#analytics-operations' | url }}">Analytics →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="frow reverse reveal">
    <figure class="shot-frame"><img loading="lazy" src="{{ '/assets/img/shots/map.webp' | url }}" width="1460" height="900" alt="Command-center map with multiple camera sources"></figure>
    <div class="frow-copy">
      <p class="section-label">Multi-camera</p>
      <h2>One command center</h2>
      <p class="muted">Every source on a live map, with re-identification linking subjects across cameras and time.</p>
      <div class="chips">{% for t in ["Re-ID + gait","Dossiers"] %}<span class="chip">{{ t }}</span>{% endfor %}</div>
      <a class="more" href="{{ '/models/reid-gait/' | url }}">Identity →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section reveal">
    <div class="head"><p class="section-label">Pipeline</p><h2>Frame to 3D, in thirteen stages</h2></div>
    <div class="ribbon">{% for s in pipeline.stages %}<span class="node">{{ s.name }}</span>{% if not loop.last %}<span class="arr">→</span>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>
    <p style="margin-top:18px"><a class="more" href="{{ '/pipeline/' | url }}">The pipeline →</a></p>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band reveal">
    <div><p class="section-label">Open source</p><h2 style="margin-top:6px">Built in the open, MIT licensed</h2></div>
    <div class="row">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{ '/docs/' | url }}">Read the docs</a>
      <a class="btn" href="{{ site.repo }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ site.repoShort }} →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>
